      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:33035:33037"
    },
    {
      "id": "138:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你走出小屋，看着陌生人沿着林间小道大步走去。你踩着早上走过的那些石头跟着他。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:33037:33077"
    },
    {
      "id": "138:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你不由自主地感到你正在做一件非常危险的事。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:33077:33100"
    },
    {
      "id": "138:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要回到小屋去锁好门，转到 120。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:33100:33119"
    },
    {
      "id": "138:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要跟着他深入森林，转到 141。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:33119:33137"
    }
  ]
}
